<http://regenbase.org/ontology#RB_0008003> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/upper_level_interpretation> "subclass of quality, but although a lot of BFO terms are reused, rb:quality is not the same as bfo:quality as the definition of rb:quality reads way differently. Although the definition of rb:condition is very broad and does not directly hint at health condition as the meaning, the subclasses damage, ischemia and pain are all health related. Still, although there seems like an ontological model as foundation, no exact philosophical grounding can be diagnosed." .
