<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontopsychiasoc#Trouble> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/term> "disorder" .
<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontopsychiasoc#Trouble> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/upper_level_interpretation> "Very narrow scope of ontopsychiasoc:disorder is_a ontopsychiasoc:concept linked to behaviour that has ontopsychiasoc:behavioural disorder as a subclass. Still, this ontology is built on Menelas top. Thus, disorder is a state and thus an intentional object in Kantain philosophical perception. But that imports the menelas top contradiction of menelastop:intentional object is_a menelastop:abstract object." .
