<http://www.limics.org/hrdo/rdfns#typ_id_11> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/upper_level_interpretation> "hrdo:disease is_a hrdo:disorder is_a hrdo:phenome. They used \"phenome\" as a high-level data wrapper to cleanly separate genes and classifications from the actual clinical expressions (symptoms, disease names, subtypes). The whole project is a pragmatic approach to improve the OrphaNet database." .
