<https://w3id.org/codo#Disease> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/upper_level_interpretation> "Oddly, three definitions are pasted from MSH, NCI and PSY. Even more oddly, codo:Disorder is_a Pathological state is_a Condition as well as Disorder is_a Condition . Finally, this definition is too weak to exclude \"hypoxemia from being in very high altitude\" which is easily reversible and can't be seen as a disease. Spoken from the definition, although pathological state seems similar to Kantian \"state\", this entity appears like not conveying any ontological meaning" .
