<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Disease> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/upper_level_interpretation> "osdi:Disease is_a osdi:Health condition is_a osdi:Model item. So again, a pragmatic grouping class rather than conveyor of philosophical meaning. Min 0 axioms convey no ontological meaning and are thus better suited as a comment or could be divided into subclasses that contain stricter existential axioms." .
