<https://w3id.org/opencare#Condition> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/logical_inconsistency> "wrong_is_a_hierarchy" .
<https://w3id.org/opencare#Condition> <https://example.org/disease-review/ap/manual_include_status> "include" .
